From ae67d20d1a9deedc9d258ad2facec801d663a98a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 00:45:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] profile: -DDPROF instrumentation of the search and the
 d-first loop (compiled out by default)

Per-layer children made / searched, TSC cycles creating them (without
their subtrees) and selecting the children, list lengths, the vectors
placed in searched nodes, and the support filter's kills (count, dead
cell, a top label, a cell of the new vector, passes); dfirst.c writes one
line per d (env DPROF_LOG, DPROF_VEC, DPROF_MINW). CMake: MAGIC_DEFS for
instrumentation build directories. Default builds unchanged (bench
quick 1,770,779 nodes).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GSaYLGdzq6d82nBLeSZFgB
